  "description": "What should I do for you to stop doing these kinds of things?\n\n*\"You are wrong, Miss Haewon. Don't think of taming me , but think of tying the leash on me.\"\n\n\"It's not like you will stay still if I tie the leash on you.\"\n\n\"Huh? Do I look like that?\"*\n\nAh Dam smiled and asked.\n\n*\"But Miss Haewon, you keep avoiding me.\"*\n\nThat's why I even thought of just pounding on you.\n\n*\"Please give me some love, Then I will listen to you well.\"*\n\nAh Dam straightened his head and smiled at me.\n\n*\"Hmmm? Miss Haewon?\"*\n\nAh Dam ' s eyes were filled with joy when he called out Haewon ' s name as if he was possessed by a passionate dream. Like an alpha who met his fateful partner.\n\n(Source: Ridibooks, translated)",
